Z||000020||Lisa 86 2m4||12-29-2000||08:46 PM||||Maybe this is a silly question, but ever since I saw the short shifter in the fierostore catalog I've wondered what are the advantages? Is it aestetic or functional?<BR>THanks for not snickering too loud!<BR>Lisa ||||reg||12
Z||000021||Cheever2||12-29-2000||08:53 PM||||I don't have mine yet, but (1)-for looks; (2)-feels better, more natural position; (3)-less obstruction to view the radio; and (4)-less throw distance.<BR>||||reg||6
